<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">📞 通话与支付</text>
    <text class="card-desc">老人通话时间过长或出现大额支出时向您告警——这是"正在被诱导转账"的两个连带信号。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">快速预设</text>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{presets}}"
        wx:key="label"
        class="chip {{activePreset === index ? 'chip-active' : ''}}"
        bindtap="onPresetTap"
        data-index="{{index}}"
      >{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="field-label">单通通话时长预警（分钟）</text>
    <input class="form-input" type="number" placeholder="1~240" value="{{call}}" bindinput="onCallInput" />
    <text class="field-label">单笔支付金额预警（元）</text>
    <input class="form-input" type="digit" placeholder="1~1000000" value="{{pay}}" bindinput="onPayInput" />
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{saving}}">保存</button>
  </view>
</view>
